 "title": "Confederacy's Only President",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "📜",
 "sentences": [
  "Jefferson Davis led a nation that existed briefly.",
  "He was the only president of the Confederate States from 1861 to 1865.",
  "Before that, he served as the 23rd United States secretary of war.",
  "Born in Kentucky, he eventually owned 113 slaves at his Brierfield Plantation.",
  "He graduated from the United States Military Academy and served six years as an army lieutenant.",
  "His first wife died from malaria just months after their wedding."
